{"case_id":"S007-N01","label":"negative","nodes":[{"node_id":"s007n01-letter","kind":"denial_communication","text":"We deny the roof portion of claim CL-703 under HO-7 § 2.1, which excludes loss caused by wear and deterioration. The reported damage is consistent with that excluded cause.","metadata":{"source_id":"denial-letter-703","source_type":"claim_letter","locator":"claim/CL-703/denial-letter","jurisdiction":"KY","claim_id":"CL-703","policy_id":"P-703","completeness":"complete","citation_status":"specific_policy_provision","template_version":"DL-2026.1"}},{"node_id":"s007n01-authority","kind":"policy_or_obligation_reference","text":"Current policy P-703 contains HO-7 § 2.1, 'Wear and Deterioration', in the applicable edition.","metadata":{"source_id":"policy-p703","source_type":"policy_form","locator":"P-703/HO-7/section-2.1","jurisdiction":"KY","policy_id":"P-703","version":"2026-01","record_status":"current"}},{"node_id":"s007n01-context","kind":"claim_context","text":"Claim CL-703 includes an inspection finding of long-term granular loss rather than a covered sudden event.","metadata":{"source_id":"claim-file-703","source_type":"claim_file","locator":"claim/CL-703/inspection","jurisdiction":"KY","claim_id":"CL-703"}}],"edges":[{"source":"s007n01-letter","target":"s007n01-authority","type":"cites_policy_provision"},{"source":"s007n01-letter","target":"s007n01-context","type":"decides_claim"}],"expected":{"smell_id":"SMELL-007","label":"negative","required_evidence_roles":["denial_communication","policy_or_obligation_reference","claim_context"]}}
{"case_id":"S007-N02","label":"negative","nodes":[{"node_id":"s007n02-letter","kind":"denial_communication","text":"We deny the request because the insured did not provide the required proof of loss within the 60-day period in Conditions § 4.2. The notice was received on March 1 and the proof arrived on May 15.","metadata":{"source_id":"denial-letter-704","source_type":"claim_letter","locator":"claim/CL-704/denial-letter","jurisdiction":"IN","claim_id":"CL-704","policy_id":"P-704","completeness":"complete","citation_status":"specific_policy_and_obligation","template_version":"DL-2026.2"}},{"node_id":"s007n02-authority","kind":"policy_or_obligation_reference","text":"Policy P-704 Conditions § 4.2 requires proof of loss within 60 days after the carrier's request.","metadata":{"source_id":"policy-p704","source_type":"policy_form","locator":"P-704/conditions/4.2","jurisdiction":"IN","policy_id":"P-704","version":"2026-02","record_status":"current"}},{"node_id":"s007n02-context","kind":"claim_context","text":"Claim CL-704 records the request date as March 1 and proof-of-loss receipt as May 15; the denial maps the dates to Conditions § 4.2.","metadata":{"source_id":"claim-file-704","source_type":"claim_file","locator":"claim/CL-704/proof-of-loss","jurisdiction":"IN","claim_id":"CL-704"}}],"edges":[{"source":"s007n02-letter","target":"s007n02-authority","type":"cites_policy_obligation"},{"source":"s007n02-letter","target":"s007n02-context","type":"decides_claim"}],"expected":{"smell_id":"SMELL-007","label":"negative","required_evidence_roles":["denial_communication","policy_or_obligation_reference","claim_context"]}}
